{
  "id": "section-other-rolls",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "other Rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,21,33]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Performing an action that has a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,33,65]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of failure requires a die roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,65,104]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "There are many types of rolls in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,104,141]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "game: Charisma rolls, Strength\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,141,172]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls, Stealth rolls, and so on. These\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,172,211]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are just names that describe the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,211,244]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "type of action being attempted.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,244,276]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A roll is always versus a difficulty\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,276,313]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "level (the target number you must\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,313,347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll on a d6) and you may apply any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,347,383]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifiers from Skills or equipment.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,383,419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "For example, a Charisma roll is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,419,451]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modified by the Charisma Skill.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,451,483]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You try to lift the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,483,512]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "heavy lid of a vampire’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,512,537]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sarcophagus. The book tells\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,537,565]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you that this requires a L5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,565,593]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Strength roll, and you add +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,593,623]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if you have the Strong Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,623,652]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and +2 if you have the Strong\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,652,682]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill at Expert level. So, if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,682,716]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do not have the Strong Skill,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,716,746]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will need to roll a 5+ to lift\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,746,781]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the lid. If you are Strong, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,781,813]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will need a 4+. If you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,813,840]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Strong at Expert level, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,840,873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-other-rolls:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "need to roll a 3+.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,873,892]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    8
  ]
}
